            "text": "theorem boundary_polynomial (P J v : ℝ) :\n    2 * (P - v) ^ 2 - (v - 2) * J ^ 2 =\n      2 * v ^ 2 - (4 * P + J ^ 2) * v + 2 * P ^ 2 + 2 * J ^ 2"
